margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。收方实际到账金额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mtext>recv</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>b</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>b</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{\\text{recv}} = A_b^{\\text{net}} - f^{fix} - \\rho A_b^{\\text{net}} - f^{corr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recv</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨境电汇的通道成本常在 10–50 bps 量级，而 SEPA 区内合规的欧元支付受 Regulation (EC) 924/2009 约束——<strong>5 万欧元以下的跨境欧元支付，收费不得高于同等的境内支付</strong>。AP 系统要把&quot;费用承担方式&quot;（OUR/BEN/SHA）作为批次级参数，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^{corr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由谁承担决定了供应商实际收到多少，进而决定供应商是否会来对账争议。</p>\n<p>时间维度上，批次还需要&quot;预计到账日&quot;（expected value date）模型，它不是简单的&quot;付款日 + N 天&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mtext>value</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>nextBusinessDay</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mtext>cutoff</mtext></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">C</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{\\text{value}} = \\text{nextBusinessDay}\\big(d^{\\text{cutoff}},\\ \\mathbb{C}_{\\text{rail}}\\big) + L_{\\text{rail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">value</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nextBusinessDay</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cutoff</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mtext>cutoff</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{\\text{cutoff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cutoff</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是通道当日截止时间（错过则顺延到下一工作日），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">C</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{C}_{\\text{rail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该通道的适用工作日历（即时支付 7×24 无日历，ACH 有，代理行还要叠加中间行的日历），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{rail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是通道本身的结算延迟。工程上必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">C</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{C}_{\\text{rail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>rail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{rail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做成可配置数据而非硬编码常量——2025 年后即时支付的普及让很多团队误以为&quot;所有通道都是秒到&quot;，而 ACH 与代理行电汇仍按工作日历运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通道选择的决策规则\">通道选择的决策规则</h2><p>把上面的约束组织成决策规则，可以落成一个纯函数。输入是（起付账户清算区、收款账户清算区、付款币种、金额、供应商收款偏好），输出是推荐通道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>推荐通道</th>\n<th>关键理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起付区 = 收款区 且 本地币种 且 金额 &lt; 阈值</td>\n<td>本地批量清算（ACH/Bacs）</td>\n<td>成本最低，有明确到账日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起付区 = 收款区 且 通道支持即时</td>\n<td>即时支付（SEPA Inst/FedNow）</td>\n<td>秒级到账，24×7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起付区 ≠ 收款区 或 非本地币种</td>\n<td>代理行电汇（CBPR+ pacs.008）</td>\n<td>唯一能跨区的常规通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收款方为个人或无对公账户</td>\n<td>卡/钱包通道</td>\n<td>无需收款方开对公账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额超过通道上限</td>\n<td>拆分或降级到电汇</td>\n<td>即时支付与 ACH 常有单笔上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阈值和上限不是拍脑袋定的：即时支付网络与 ACH 都设有单笔金额上限，各参与机构还可以设置更低的限额；AP 系统应把上限当作通道元数据缓存。供应商侧还有一层偏好——有的明确要求&quot;只收 SEPA 转账&quot;，有的坚持电汇到指定中间行，这些偏好应作为供应商主数据的一部分参与决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败恢复-退汇-追踪与幂等\">失败恢复：退汇、追踪与幂等</h2><p>跨境付款最贵的时刻不是发起，而是<strong>发起之后出了意外</strong>。常见失败有三类：报文被收款行拒绝（账户已关闭、结构化地址不匹配、制裁筛查命中）、中间行扣费导致到账金额小于发票净额、以及发起端超时但银行端已受理。第三类最危险——系统若在超时后盲目重试，就会造成重复付款。</p>\n<p>两条工程纪律能覆盖大部分风险。第一，<strong>端到端参考号（UETR）必须自己生成并持久化</strong>，在指令提交前就写入本地状态机；超时后先按 UETR 查询真实状态，只有在确认未被受理时才重发，且重发沿用同一参考号。第二，<strong>批次项要有独立状态机</strong>（已生成 → 已提交 → 已受理 → 已结算 / 已退汇），退汇（return）是正常状态而非异常——它会带着退汇原因码回到批次，进入例外队列等待重新配对或改走其他通道。这与<a href=\"../matching-approval/three-way-match-model\">三单匹配</a>里&quot;例外队列&quot;的思路一致：把偏离主路径的情况显式建模成可处置状态，而不是靠日志排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把这一篇的结论压缩成一份可执行的检查表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>付款批次必须有<strong>冻结快照</strong>，含发票集、汇率、总额、费用承担方式；重跑批次基于快照生成差异项，不重复扣款。</li>\n<li>通道选择实现为<strong>纯函数</strong>，输入清算区/币种/金额/偏好，输出通道；上限、截止时间、工作日历作为通道元数据缓存。</li>\n<li>付款指令建模为<strong>通道无关领域对象</strong>，通道专有格式与长度限制留在适配器里；收款人地址按 ISO 20022 <strong>结构化地址</strong>建模，不要再用单一自由文本字段。</li>\n<li>每条指令生成并持久化 <strong>UETR</strong>，超时后按 UETR 查状态再决定是否重发；批次项状态机显式包含<strong>退汇</strong>状态与退汇原因码，退汇进入例外队列而非静默失败。</li>\n<li>供应商主数据记录<strong>收款偏好与收款账户标识类型</strong>（IBAN / 路由号+账号 / 卡号），供通道选择与适配器使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套模型的边界在&quot;付款&quot;这一侧：它假设发票已经匹配通过、金额已确定。发票如何进入系统、字段如何抽取，是本章前两个章节的主题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"付款批次与结算通道模型","id":"付款批次与结算通道模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：批次解决什么","id":"核心概念-批次解决什么"},{"level":2,"text":"结算通道的四种类型","id":"结算通道的四种类型"},{"level":2,"text":"ISO 20022 迁移：2025-11 是一条真正的分界线","id":"iso-20022-迁移-2025-11-是一条真正的分界线"},{"level":2,"text":"批次到结算的资金模型","id":"批次到结算的资金模型"},{"level":2,"text":"通道选择的决策规则","id":"通道选择的决策规则"},{"level":2,"text":"失败恢复：退汇、追踪与幂等","id":"失败恢复-退汇-追踪与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"审批路由、职责分离与审计轨迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/matching-approval/approval-routing-segregation-of-duties"},"next":{"title":"跨境汇率、VAT 与预提税处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/payment-vat-crossborder/crossborder-fx-vat-withholding"}}